@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+{
+  "file": "src/agents.ts",
+  "snippet": "maxTurns: 0,",
+  "cause": "The triage agent is defined with maxTurns: 0, so as soon as the model makes a delegation tool call the genkit generate loop aborts with 'Exceeded maximum tool call iterations (0)', while plain greetings never reach a tool call and succeed.",
+  "evidence": "Calling triage.chat().send('Where is order A-1001?') failed with 'ABORTED: Exceeded maximum tool call iterations (0)' before the fix, while orderAgent answered the same question directly; genkit's generate/action.js uses `rawRequest.maxTurns ?? 5` and throws when `currentTurn + 1 > maxIterations`, so 0 rejects any tool request. After changing it to 4, triage returns the correct order A-1001 answer and 'hello' still gets a greeting."
+}
